{"type": "root", "attrs": {"type": "node", "context": "sop", "internal": "shotsculpt::2.0", "icon": "SOP/shotsculpt", "version": "2.0", "since": "21.0", "tags": "", "namespace": null}, "body": [{"level": 0, "type": "title", "indent": 0, "text": ["Shot Sculpt"], "extent": [0, 16]}, {"level": 0, "type": "title", "indent": 0, "text": ["Shot Sculpt"], "extent": [128, 144]}, {"type": "summary", "indent": 0, "text": ["Interactive tool for creating and managing time-based deformations."], "extent": [144, 220]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["This tool allows you to create geometric deformations and manage how they change and blend across time. \nThe viewport state for this node grants access to the full set of brushes from the ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/sculpt", "type": "link", "text": ["Sculpt SOP"], "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/sculpt.html"}, ", allowing you to interactively sculpt your deformations."], "extent": [220, 495]}, {"type": "video_group", "body": [{"ext": null, "type": "video", "indent": 0, "role": "item", "extent": [495, 503], "body": [], "container": true, "attrs": {"src": "/videos/shotsculpt_creature.webm"}}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"level": 2, "id": null, "container": true, "type": "h", "indent": 0, "text": ["Poses and Clips"], "extent": [547, 569], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The main interface for this tool is the ", {"scheme": null, "value": "/ref/panes/shotsculpt.html", "type": "link", "text": ["Shot Sculpt Pane"], "fullpath": "/ref/panes/shotsculpt.html"}, ". An editor that organizes your deformations within a timeline. \n    Sculpt edits are saved as ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, ", each is assigned to a single frame. \n    ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, " represent snapshots of what the resulting geometry looks like at that frame frame and acts as keyframes that represent a shape/deformation."], "extent": [569, 956]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": [{"scheme": "Image", "value": "/images/nodes/sop/shotsculpt_clipoverview.png", "type": "img", "text": ""}], "extent": [956, 1015]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Clips"]}, " act as the main container for ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, ". \n    A ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " can house more than one pose and across the frame range between adjacent ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, ". The left-most ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " will blend into the right-most. \n    ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clips"]}, " also have designated frame ranges before and after the first and last ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, ", allowing control over how they ease in and out."], "extent": [1015, 1369]}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 4, "role": "item", "extent": [1369, 1379], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": [{"scheme": "Image", "value": "/images/nodes/sop/shotsculpt_clipoutput.png", "type": "img", "text": ""}, "\n        Each ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " will impose one deformation on your input geometry. This deformation will be a linear combination of the shapes associated with the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, " within this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, ". "], "extent": [1379, 1627]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["At the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " level, you can specify the reference frame that your deformations should be applied within. \n    There are options for ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["World Space"]}, ", ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Tangent Space"]}, ", and ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Joint Space"]}, ". "], "extent": [1627, 1825]}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 4, "text": [" "], "role": "item", "extent": [1825, 1836], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["For ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Joint Space"]}, " to function, the input geometry must have a ", {"type": "code", "text": ["boneCapture"]}, " attribute, and you must provide an ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Animated Pose"]}, "."], "extent": [1836, 1977]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}]}, {"level": 2, "id": null, "container": true, "type": "h", "indent": 0, "text": ["Tracks"], "extent": [1977, 1990], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Tracks"]}, " are an organizational tool, allowing you to group your ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clips"]}, " together. \n    There is also an animatable float parameter at the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, " level, whose value weights the overall deformation a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " will impose."], "extent": [1990, 2222]}, {"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 4, "text": ["Track Types"], "extent": [2222, 2239], "body": [{"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 10, "type": "bullet", "indent": 8, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Sculpt Tracks"]}, " grant access to the full set of brushes from the Sculpt SOP, allowing the interactive manipulation of point positions that become baked into ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, ". "], "extent": [2239, 2420]}, {"blevel": 10, "type": "bullet", "indent": 8, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Mask Tracks"]}, " constrain your viewport interaction to the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Attribute Paint"]}, " brush, which paints a point float attribute on your geometry. The values of this attribute are also baked into ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, " and interpolate across time. This attribute is present on the output geometry, allowing you to drive downstream effects with a time-dependent point attribute."], "extent": [2420, 2798]}], "container": true}, {"type": "video_group", "body": [{"ext": null, "type": "video", "indent": 8, "role": "item", "extent": [2798, 2814], "body": [], "container": true, "attrs": {"src": "/videos/shotsculpt_blendshapetrack.webm"}}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 10, "type": "bullet", "indent": 8, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Tracks"]}, " require the specification of a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Target"]}, ", which can be any geometry with the same point count as the geometry you are Shot Sculpting. They are identical to ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Mask Tracks"]}, " in that your viewport interaction is constrained to the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Attribute Paint"]}, " brush. Instead of being present on the output geometry, the attribute values are used directly to blend points between their current positions, and their corresponding positions within the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Target"]}, "."], "extent": [2872, 3377]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "container": true}]}, {"level": 2, "id": null, "container": true, "type": "h", "indent": 0, "text": ["How Shot Sculpt Works"], "extent": [3377, 3405], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["There is an invisible Stash parameter on this node, called ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["deformation_stash"]}, ". This detail contains one packed primitive per ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " that exists within the node. Each packed primitive represents the shape/deformation this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " is associated with."], "extent": [3405, 3662]}, {"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 0, "text": ["Accessing Shapes"], "extent": [3662, 3680], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Geometry is processed as clusters as a performance optimization. Each shape is stored as a subset of the clusters representing the input geometry. "], "extent": [3680, 3837]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Unpacking an entry in the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["deformation_stash"]}, " will yield this subset of clusters representing a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose\u2019s"]}, " shape. Each cluster is a packed primitive itself. Unpacking these clusters and merging them will yield an overestimate of the sculpted shape. If you blast any points whose ", {"type": "code", "text": ["diff"]}, " attribute is ", {"type": "code", "text": ["{0, 0, 0}"]}, ", you will get the minimal representation of it."], "extent": [3837, 4207]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The ", {"type": "code", "text": ["_idx"]}, " attribute on points within clusters maps them to their original point number within the input geometry. Once clusters are unpacked and merged, any points with matching ", {"type": "code", "text": ["_idx"]}, " values should be fused if a continuous surface is desired."], "extent": [4207, 4457]}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 0, "text": ["Cooking Process"], "extent": [4457, 4474], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Shot Sculpt first determines which ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clips"]}, " the playhead is currently intersecting with, encoding this data within a dictionary attribute where each entry represents a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " that should impose a deformation."], "extent": [4474, 4695]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["It iterates over each entry and identifies the shapes within the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["deformation_stash"]}, " to unpack, and apply the appropriate linear combination of these shapes upon the input geometry."], "extent": [4695, 4884]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Clips"]}, " are applied in their ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, " order, and within a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, ", it uses the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " order from left-to-right (using the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip\u2019s"]}, " left-edge)."], "extent": [4884, 5041]}], "container": true}], "container": true}]}, {"level": 2, "id": null, "container": true, "type": "h", "indent": 0, "text": ["Tips"], "extent": [5041, 5052], "body": [{"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": ["When  you sculpt with the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track Weight"]}, " below 1, the internally recorded deformation will be a magnified version of your sculpt edit. The ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track Weight"]}, " is then applied to lessen your deformation\u2019s presence, the post-processed result in the viewport matches the shape you had just sculpted. "], "extent": [5052, 5352], "body": [{"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["If you later increase the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track Weight"]}, ", you will see the magnified version of your shape. If not desired, try using the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend To Rest"]}, " Viewport Slider to lessen the deformation\u2019s presence, the result of which will propagate to what is recorded internally."], "extent": [5352, 5622]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 0, "text": ["Options for Non-Sculpted Deformations"], "extent": [5622, 5661], "body": [{"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["The main method to create creating deformations is the Sculpt SOP but there may be certain edits you can\u2019t produce using sculpting. There are two options for introducing deformations coming from other SOPs into the Shot Sculpt interpolation scheme: ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Tracks"]}, " and ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Imported Poses"]}, "."], "extent": [5661, 5963]}], "container": true}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 4, "role": "item", "extent": [5963, 5973], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["A main distinction between ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Tracks"]}, " and ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Imported Poses"]}, " is the lifetime of Shot Sculpt\u2019s dependency on the SOP providing the edit."], "extent": [5973, 6129]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 4, "text": ["Blendshape Tracks"], "extent": [6129, 6152], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["Within ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Tracks"]}, ", the painted attribute\u2019s values interpolate point positions between their current values, and their corresponding values within the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Target"]}, ". This interpolation occurs dynamically, each time Shot Sculpt cooks. "], "extent": [6152, 6422]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["This means that any changes made to the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Target"]}, " will propagate to the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Track"]}, "'s resulting deformation, even after ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clips"]}, " and ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, " have been created. Further, moving a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " within a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Track"]}, " will query point positions within the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Target"]}, " across the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, "'s new frame range. This also means that ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Targets"]}, " will cook whenever Shot Sculpt cooks, potentially hindering performance."], "extent": [6422, 6888]}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 4, "text": ["Imported Poses"], "extent": [6888, 6908], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["When importing a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, ", the shape diff between Shot Sculpt\u2019s input and the import target is only computed at the time this acion takes place which makes it static. "], "extent": [6908, 7093]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["Future edits to the import target will not propagate to Shot Sculpt, and moving ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clips"]}, " will not recompute the shape diff across the new frame range. Effectively, the imported deformation is understood internally as if you had manually sculpted it."], "extent": [7093, 7353]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 0, "text": ["Reference Frames"], "extent": [7353, 7371], "body": [{"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["Once the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Animated Pose"]}, " and ", {"type": "code", "text": ["boneCapture"]}, " attribute have been provided, any existing deformations will still be unable to use ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Joint Space"]}, ". Only future edits will have this capability."], "extent": [7371, 7569]}, {"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Tangent Space"]}, " may perform poorly around areas where geometry creases, potentially resulting in artifacts such as interpenetration. The best alternative is to use ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Joint Space"]}, ", but if an ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Animated Pose"]}, " is unavailable, ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Tracks"]}, " are another option. "], "extent": [7569, 7850], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 6, "text": ["For example, if you use Smooth Brush on a character\u2019s armpit and the deformation is not translating well in ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Tangent Space"]}, " across adjacent frames. A ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Track"]}, " whose ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Target"]}, " is the Smooth SOP will replicate this, but will eliminate ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Tangent Space\u2019s"]}, " artifacts by querying the smoothed point positions at every frame rather than transforming 3D displacements."], "extent": [7850, 8245]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 0, "text": ["Rest Poses"], "extent": [8245, 8257], "body": [{"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Rest Poses"]}, " are identical to ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, ", but are not associated with any deformation. These act as a way to specify frames within a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip\u2019s"]}, " interpolation scheme, towards which adjacent ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, " should blend out. "], "extent": [8257, 8487], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 6, "text": ["You can think of ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clips"]}, " as being automatically delimited by ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Rest Poses"]}, ", allowing the first and last ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, " to ease in and out. "], "extent": [8487, 8632]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 0, "text": ["Custom Blend Curves"], "extent": [8632, 8653], "body": [{"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["As of now, there is no means of managing custom blend curves across a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip\u2019s"]}, " ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Frames In"]}, ", ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Frames Out"]}, ", or a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses\u2019s"]}, " ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend To Next"]}, ". There are multiple preset curves that can be selected from but if you require more intricate control, the best option would be to set the Clip\u2019s ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend In"]}, " and ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend Out"]}, " to ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Hold"]}, ", and animate the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track Weight"]}, " manually. "], "extent": [8653, 9041]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "container": true}]}, {"level": 1, "id": "parameters", "container": true, "type": "parameters_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [9041, 9053], "body": [{"level": 2, "id": null, "container": true, "type": "h", "indent": 0, "text": ["General"], "extent": [9053, 9068], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["Open Shot Sculpt Pane"], "extent": [9068, 9092], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Opens the Shot Sculpt pane window at the bottom of the viewport."], "extent": [9121, 9191]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "openshotsculptpane"}}, {"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Selected Track"], "extent": [9191, 9207], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The currently selected ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, ". \n    Any edits created through viewport interactions will be assigned to a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " within this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, ". \n    Similarly, pasting copied objects, importing ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, ", and the creation of ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Rest Poses"]}, " all apply to the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Selected Track"]}, "."], "extent": [9231, 9510]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "selectedtrack"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Create Rest Pose"], "extent": [9510, 9528], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Creates a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Rest Pose"]}, " at the playhead within the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Selected Track"]}, ". \n    If the playhead is intersecting an existing ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, ", the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Rest Pose"]}, " will be appended to it. \n    Otherwise, a new ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " will be created. If the playhead is intersecting an existing ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, ", the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Rest Pose"]}, " will replace it."], "extent": [9553, 9867]}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 4, "role": "item", "extent": [9867, 9877], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["A ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Rest Pose"]}, " is identical to any other ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, ", but is not associated with a deformation. \n        These act as a way to specify frames within a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip\u2019s"]}, " interpolation scheme, towards which adjacent ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, " should blend out."], "extent": [9877, 10119]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "createrestpose"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Import Pose"], "extent": [10119, 10132], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Allows the importing of deformations created outside the Shot Sculpt node. This button opens a Node Picker dialogue. \n    When you select a SOP whose geometry has the same point count as Shot Sculpt\u2019s input geometry, the shape diff between the two will be inserted as a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, ", at the playhead and within the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Selected Track"]}, "."], "extent": [10153, 10489]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["If the playhead is intersecting an existing ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, ", the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Imported Pose"]}, " will be appended to it. \n    Otherwise, a new ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " will be created. If the playhead is intersecting an existing ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, ", the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Imported Pose"]}, " will replace it."], "extent": [10489, 10735]}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 4, "role": "item", "extent": [10735, 10745], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["This uses Shot Sculpt\u2019s interpolation scheme to manage deformations that are not desired to create with the Sculpt SOP\u2019s set of brushes."], "extent": [10745, 10891]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "importpose"}, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"level": 4, "type": "sep", "indent": 0, "text": [" Color Visualization "], "extent": [10891, 10921], "body": [{"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Mode"], "extent": [10949, 10959], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["Colors are assigned at the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, ", ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, ", and ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " level.\n        This menu allows the specification of how deformations being applied on your geometry should be colored in the viewport. \n        The colors of entities within the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Shot Sculpt Pane"]}, " will also align with the option selected from this menu. "], "extent": [10982, 11310]}, {"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 8, "text": ["Track Color"], "extent": [11310, 11332], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": ["All deformations will be colored using their corresponding ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track\u2019s"]}, " color."], "extent": [11332, 11423]}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 8, "text": ["Clip Color"], "extent": [11423, 11444], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": ["All deformations will be colored using their corresponding ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip\u2019s"]}, " color."], "extent": [11444, 11534]}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 8, "text": ["Pose Color"], "extent": [11534, 11555], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": ["Each deformation will be colored using its ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " color. Across the frame range between adjacent ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, ", the left-most\u2019s color will blend into the right-most\u2019s color."], "extent": [11555, 11740]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "colormode"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Selected Track"], "extent": [11740, 11760], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["Specifies whether deformations resulting from the currently ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Selected Track"]}, " should appear colored in the viewport."], "extent": [11792, 11919]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "selectedtrackcolor"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Other Tracks"], "extent": [11919, 11937], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["Specifies whether deformations resulting from currently unselected ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Tracks"]}, " should appear colored in the viewport."], "extent": [11967, 12093]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "othertrackscolor"}, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "colorvisualization"}}, {"level": 4, "type": "sep", "indent": 0, "text": [" Track Parameters "], "extent": [12093, 12120], "body": [{"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Enable"], "extent": [12145, 12157], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["Specifies whether deformations resulting from this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, " should be applied upon your geometry."], "extent": [12182, 12290]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "trackenable"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Name"], "extent": [12290, 12300], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["Allows you to give your ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, " a title. There is no requirement for uniqueness amongst ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, " names."], "extent": [12323, 12439]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "trackname"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Color"], "extent": [12439, 12450], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["The color associated with this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, "."], "extent": [12474, 12525]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "trackcolor"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Type"], "extent": [12525, 12535], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["The type of this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, ". Please see the above section describing ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track Types"]}, "."], "extent": [12558, 12652]}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 8, "role": "item", "extent": [12652, 12666], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, " created within ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Sculpt Tracks"]}, " manipulate point positions, and if moved to ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Tracks"]}, " or ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Mask Tracks"]}, " will result in an error state and thus won\u2019t be applied on your geometry. \n            Similarly, ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, " created within ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Tracks"]}, " or ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Mask Tracks"]}, " cannot be moved to ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Sculpt Tracks"]}, ". \n            However, ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, " within ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Tracks"]}, " and ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Mask Tracks"]}, " can be interchanged."], "extent": [12666, 13111]}], "container": true}, {"type": "note", "indent": 8, "role": "item", "extent": [13111, 13125], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": ["Within ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blendshape Tracks"]}, " and ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Mask Tracks"]}, ", when the playhead intersects a region of ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " overlap, the maximum attribute value per-point will be used, no matter which ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " it results from."], "extent": [13125, 13341]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "tracktype"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Locked"], "extent": [13341, 13353], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["Specifies whether this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, " should be locked. Locked ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Tracks"]}, " cannot be edited, meaning any viewport interaction done while a locked ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, " is selected will be rejected. \n        Similarly, pasting copied objects, importing ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Poses"]}, ", and the creation of ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Rest Poses"]}, " will all be rejected if the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Selected Track"]}, " is locked."], "extent": [13378, 13725]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "tracklocked"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Weight"], "extent": [13725, 13737], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["A float parameter whose value weights all deformations on this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, ", as well as their associated colors within the viewport."], "extent": [13762, 13901]}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 8, "role": "item", "extent": [13901, 13915], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": ["When sculpting while the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Weight"]}, " is below 1, the internally recorded deformation will be a magnified version of your sculpt edit. When the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Weight"]}, " is then applied to lessen your deformation\u2019s presence, the post-processed result in the viewport matches the shape you sculpted. "], "extent": [13915, 14223]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": ["If you increase the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Weight"]}, ", you will see the magnified version of your shape. If not desired, try using the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend To Rest"]}, " Viewport Slider to lessen the deformation\u2019s presence."], "extent": [14223, 14420]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "trackweight"}, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "trackparameters"}}, {"level": 4, "type": "sep", "indent": 0, "text": [" Clip Parameters "], "extent": [14420, 14446], "body": [{"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Name"], "extent": [14470, 14480], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["Allows you to give your ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " a title. There is no requirement for uniqueness amongst ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " names."], "extent": [14480, 14594]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Color"], "extent": [14594, 14605], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["The color associated with this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, "."], "extent": [14605, 14655]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Blend In"], "extent": [14655, 14669], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["This menu allows specification of the curve to blend in the first ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " within this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, ". \n        The function is evaluated across a specific number of frames preceding the first ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, ", specified by ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Frames In"]}, " and the resulting value weights the first ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, "."], "extent": [14669, 14954]}, {"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 8, "text": ["Linear"], "extent": [14954, 14970], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": [{"scheme": "Image", "value": "/images/nodes/sop/shotsculpt_linear.png", "type": "img", "text": ""}], "extent": [14970, 15031]}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 8, "text": ["Hold"], "extent": [15031, 15045], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": [{"scheme": "Image", "value": "/images/nodes/sop/shotsculpt_hold.png", "type": "img", "text": ""}], "extent": [15045, 15104]}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 8, "text": ["Smooth"], "extent": [15104, 15120], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": [{"scheme": "Image", "value": "/images/nodes/sop/shotsculpt_smooth.png", "type": "img", "text": ""}], "extent": [15120, 15181]}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 8, "text": ["Ease In"], "extent": [15181, 15198], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": [{"scheme": "Image", "value": "/images/nodes/sop/shotsculpt_easein.png", "type": "img", "text": ""}], "extent": [15198, 15259]}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 8, "text": ["Ease Out"], "extent": [15259, 15277], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": [{"scheme": "Image", "value": "/images/nodes/sop/shotsculpt_easeout.png", "type": "img", "text": ""}], "extent": [15277, 15339]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Blend Out"], "extent": [15339, 15354], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["This menu allows specification of the curve to blend out the last ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " within this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, ". "], "extent": [15354, 15461]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["The function is evaluated across a specific number of frames following the last ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, ", specified by ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Frames Out"]}, ", and the resulting value weights the last ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, "."], "extent": [15461, 15640]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["The menu options are identical to those within the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend In"]}, " parameter."], "extent": [15640, 15724]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Frames In"], "extent": [15724, 15739], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["The number of frames preceding the first ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " over which ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend In"]}, " will be applied."], "extent": [15739, 15839]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Frames Out"], "extent": [15839, 15855], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["The number of frames following the last ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " over which ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend Out"]}, " will be applied."], "extent": [15855, 15955]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Edit Reference Frame"], "extent": [15955, 15981], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["Determines the space within which sculpt edits will be applied at other frames. "], "extent": [15981, 16071]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["When a sculpt edit is captured, the per-point 3D displacements are relative to the geometry\u2019s state at that frame. \n        When applying this deformation upon adjacent frames, you may want the 3D displacements to be transformed to achieve more consistent results."], "extent": [16071, 16345]}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 8, "role": "item", "extent": [16345, 16359], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": ["No matter what reference frame you are using, when your playhead lies directly upon a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, ", its associated 3D displacement will remain untransformed."], "extent": [16359, 16526]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 8, "text": ["World Space"], "extent": [16526, 16547], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": ["The delta remains untransformed."], "extent": [16547, 16593]}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 8, "text": ["Tangent Space"], "extent": [16593, 16616], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": ["The delta is transformed by the change that occurred to a point\u2019s tangent plane/normal vector."], "extent": [16616, 16724]}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 12, "role": "item", "extent": [16724, 16742], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 16, "text": ["Tangent Space may perform poorly around areas where geometry creases, potentially resulting in artifacts such as interpenetration. \n                The normal data in these regions can be highly volatile, and unreliable to act as the basis for transforming 3D displacements."], "extent": [16742, 17034]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 8, "text": ["Joint Space"], "extent": [17034, 17055], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": ["The delta is transformed by the change that occurred to a point\u2019s associated joints."], "extent": [17055, 17165]}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 12, "role": "item", "extent": [17165, 17183], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 16, "text": ["To use ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Joint Space"]}, ", the input geometry must have a ", {"type": "code", "text": ["boneCapture"]}, " attribute, and you must provide an ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Animated Pose"]}, ".\n                Upon providing this data, any existing deformations will still be unable to use ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Joint Space"]}, ". Only future edits will have this capability."], "extent": [17183, 17481]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true}], "container": true}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 8, "role": "item", "extent": [17481, 17495], "body": [{"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 12, "text": ["Comparing World and Tangent Space"], "extent": [17495, 17543], "body": [{"type": "video_group", "body": [{"ext": null, "type": "video", "indent": 16, "role": "item", "extent": [17543, 17567], "body": [], "container": true, "attrs": {"src": "/videos/shotsculpt_worldtangent.webm"}}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 12, "text": ["Comparing Tangent and Joint Space"], "extent": [17631, 17678], "body": [{"type": "video_group", "body": [{"ext": null, "type": "video", "indent": 16, "role": "item", "extent": [17678, 17702], "body": [], "container": true, "attrs": {"src": "/videos/shotsculpt_tangentjoint.webm"}}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "clipparameters"}}, {"level": 4, "type": "sep", "indent": 0, "text": [" Pose Parameters "], "extent": [17767, 17793], "body": [{"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Blend To Next"], "extent": [17817, 17836], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["This menu allows specification of the curve to blend in the next ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " within this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, ". "], "extent": [17836, 17942]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["This menu will be off for the last ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " within a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " (applicable to ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clips"]}, " with only one ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, "), as it is the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend Out"]}, " parameter at the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " level that dictates how the last ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " eases out."], "extent": [17942, 18169]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["The menu options are identical to those within the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend In"]}, " parameter at the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, " level, with the exception of ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Hold"]}, ", which is unavailable in the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend To Next"]}, " menu."], "extent": [18169, 18359]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Sculpt Frame"], "extent": [18359, 18377], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["The frame that this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " is assigned to. When the playhead is on this frame, the associated shape will be weighted at 100%."], "extent": [18377, 18514]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Color"], "extent": [18514, 18525], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["The color associated with this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, "."], "extent": [18525, 18575]}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 8, "role": "item", "extent": [18575, 18589], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 12, "text": ["This parameter is hidden for ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Rest Poses"]}, ", which are colored white."], "extent": [18589, 18672]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 4, "text": ["Jump to Frame"], "extent": [18672, 18691], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["When pressed, the playhead will jump to this ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose\u2019s"]}, " ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Sculpt Frame"]}, "."], "extent": [18691, 18774]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "poseparameters"}}]}, {"level": 2, "id": null, "container": true, "type": "h", "indent": 0, "text": ["Sculpt"], "extent": [18774, 18787], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["This tab contains the full set of parameters from the Sculpt SOP.\nPlease see ", {"scheme": null, "value": "https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/sop/sculpt.html", "type": "link", "text": ["Sculpt\u2019s Help Card"], "exists": true}, " for more information on the Sculpt parameters."], "extent": [18787, 18992]}]}, {"level": 2, "id": null, "container": true, "type": "h", "indent": 0, "text": ["Defaults"], "extent": [18992, 19007], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["This tab contains certain parameters that exist within the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Track"]}, ", ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Clip"]}, ", and ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " multiparms. \nHere, you may set preferred default values that will apply to any newly created objects."], "extent": [19007, 19204]}, {"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Tracks"], "extent": [19204, 19212], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Type"]}, "."], "extent": [19236, 19251]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "trackdefaults"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Clips"], "extent": [19251, 19258], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend In"]}, ", ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend Out"]}, ", ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Frames In"]}, ", ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Frames Out"]}, ", ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Edit Reference Frame"]}, "."], "extent": [19281, 19372]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "clipdefaults"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Poses"], "extent": [19372, 19379], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Blend To Next"]}, "."], "extent": [19402, 19426]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "posedefaults"}, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}]}], "text": "Parameters"}, {"level": 1, "id": "miscellaneous", "container": true, "type": "miscellaneous_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [19426, 19441], "body": [{"level": 2, "id": null, "container": true, "type": "h", "indent": 0, "text": ["Viewport Sliders"], "extent": [19441, 19465], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["These viewport sliders can be used on any frame and are similar to the sliders in the Animation Toolbar, but adjusted for Shot Sculpting."], "extent": [19492, 19635]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Each slider will create a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " at the current frame, within the ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Selected Track"]}, ". If a ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " already exists at this frame, it will be replaced.\n    For each slider, the value acts as a blend weight between a source and a target."], "extent": [19635, 19878]}, {"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 4, "text": ["Bias From Current"], "extent": [19878, 19901], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Source:"]}, " The geometry at the current frame"], "extent": [19901, 19956]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Target:"]}, " An adjacent ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, ". When the value is positive, it is the following ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " in the timeline. When the value is negative, it is the preceding ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, "."], "extent": [19956, 20131]}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 4, "text": ["Bias From Rest"], "extent": [20131, 20151], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Source:"]}, " A ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Rest Pose"]}, "."], "extent": [20151, 20189]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Target:"]}, " An adjacent ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, ". When the value is positive, it is the following ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, " in the timeline. When the value is negative, it is the preceding ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Pose"]}, "."], "extent": [20189, 20364]}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 4, "text": ["Blend To Rest"], "extent": [20364, 20383], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Source:"]}, " The geometry at the current frame."], "extent": [20383, 20439]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": [{"type": "ui", "text": ["Target:"]}, " A ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Rest Pose"]}, "."], "extent": [20439, 20477]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "attrs": {"id": "viewportsliders"}}], "text": "Miscellaneous"}, {"level": 1, "id": "inputs", "container": true, "type": "inputs_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [20477, 20485], "body": [{"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 0, "text": ["Geometry to Deform"], "extent": [20485, 20506], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The geometry to perform Shot Sculpting upon."], "extent": [20506, 20556]}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 4, "role": "item", "extent": [20556, 20566], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["To have the reference frame for a sculpt edit be in ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Joint Space"]}, ", the geometry to deform must contain the ", {"type": "code", "text": ["boneCapture"]}, " point attribute."], "extent": [20566, 20715]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "container": true}, {"type": "dt", "indent": 0, "text": ["Animated Pose"], "extent": [20715, 20730], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The geometry\u2019s ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Animated Pose"]}, ". Only required if you intend to use ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["Joint Space"]}, " as the reference frame for a sculpt edit."], "extent": [20730, 20862]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "text": "Inputs"}, {"level": 1, "id": "outputs", "container": true, "type": "outputs_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [20862, 20871], "body": [{"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 0, "text": ["Deformed Geometry"], "extent": [20871, 20891], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The input geometry with all deformations applied on top."], "extent": [20891, 20951]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "text": "Outputs"}], "title": ["Shot Sculpt"], "summary": ["Interactive tool for creating and managing time-based deformations."]}